msgid "Assemblies"
msgstr "装配"

msgid "Orbit bundles annotation for 18 assemblies across 9 species. Sequence is not bundled — it is streamed from UCSC on demand, which is what keeps the download small."
msgstr "Orbit 内置 9 个物种共 18 个装配的注释。序列不打包——按需从 UCSC 流式读取，这也是下载体积小的原因。"

msgid "Bundled assemblies"
msgstr "内置装配"

msgid "Assembly selector listing human and model-organism reference builds"
msgstr "装配选择菜单，列出人类与模式物种的参考版本"

msgid "Choose the reference build before searching or importing. The bundled annotation list is not a claim that these are the newest available assemblies."
msgstr "搜索或导入前先选择参考装配。内置注释列表并不表示这些是目前可获得的最新装配版本。"

