msgid "Each assembly carries gene models, cytobands, chromosome sizes and the primary chromosome order used by the overview panel."
msgstr "每个装配都带基因模型、细胞遗传带、染色体长度，以及总览面板使用的主染色体顺序。"

msgid "How sequence is fetched"
msgstr "序列怎么取"

msgid "Every assembly in ``data/catalog.json`` records a ``twoBitURL`` pointing at the UCSC 2bit file. When you navigate, Orbit issues an HTTP Range request for just the bytes covering the window and decodes them locally."
msgstr "``data/catalog.json`` 里每个装配都记录了一个指向 UCSC 2bit 文件的 ``twoBitURL``。导航时 Orbit 只对窗口覆盖的字节发 HTTP Range 请求，在本地解码。"

msgid "Response time depends on the network and reference index."
msgstr "响应时间取决于网络状况和参考索引。"

msgid "The range cache is in memory and per session, not a persistent offline genome."
msgstr "区间缓存位于内存中，仅在本次会话有效，不是持久保存的离线基因组。"

msgid "Local 2bit takes priority over the remote source."
msgstr "本地 2bit 优先于远程序列源。"

msgid "If the network is unavailable, the sequence and GC tracks go grey and everything else keeps working."
msgstr "网络不可用时，序列和 GC 轨道变灰，其余功能照常。"

msgid "Offline mode"
msgstr "离线模式"

msgid "Set ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` before launching to disable remote 2bit fallback. A local matching 2bit supplies built-in reference operations offline. Imported FASTA remains an independent sequence track; see :doc:`sequence`::"
msgstr "启动前设置 ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` 可禁用远程 2bit 回退。匹配的本地 2bit 支持内置参考序列操作离线工作。导入 FASTA 仍是独立序列轨道；详见 :doc:`sequence` 。"

msgid "With no local sequence the GC and sequence tracks stay disabled, but genes, cytobands, search and imported tracks are unaffected."
msgstr "没有本地序列时，GC 和序列轨道保持禁用，但基因、细胞遗传带、搜索和导入的轨道不受影响。"

msgid "Working with a non-model organism"
msgstr "非模式物种：用自己组装的基因组和注释"

msgid "You do not need a catalog entry to look at your own assembly. Pick the empty **Custom** assembly, import the genome FASTA, then import the annotation. Orbit builds the chromosome axis from the files themselves, so a newly assembled genome with names like ``scaffold_1`` works the same way a reference build does."
msgstr "不必先改 catalog 就能看自己的装配：在装配菜单里选空的 **自定义**，先导入基因组 FASTA，再导入注释。Orbit 用这两个文件本身建立染色体轴，所以 ``scaffold_1`` 这种新组装的名字和参考基因组一样能用。"

msgid "Order matters only in that the FASTA has to arrive before anything that needs a coordinate axis; the gene track draws itself as soon as the annotation is parsed."
msgstr "顺序只要求 FASTA 先到：任何需要坐标轴的东西都得等它；注释一解析完，基因轨道就会自己画出来。"

msgid "A three-scaffold assembly (``scaffold_1``, 150 kb) with its own GFF3. The annotation track reports *5 genes* over a 40 kb window; the FASTA track below it holds the sequence and switches to bases once you zoom past 1.2 bp/px. The bundled RefSeq, GC and ideogram rows are hidden because a custom assembly has no cytobands and no bundled annotation for them to draw."
msgstr "一套三条 scaffold 的装配（``scaffold_1``，150 kb）连同它自己的 GFF3。注释轨道在 40 kb 窗口里显示 *5 个基因*；下面的 FASTA 轨道存着序列，放大到 1.2 bp/px 以内就切换成碱基。内置的 RefSeq、GC 和染色体示意图已隐藏——自定义装配没有条带，也没有内置注释可画。"

msgid "Both strands, exons and introns come from the file, not from any assumption about the organism:"
msgstr "正负链、外显子和内含子都来自文件本身，不依赖任何物种假设："

msgid "Collapsed view: gene models packed onto one row, exon boxes and intron lines drawn from the GFF3. ``g1`` runs 5'→3' to the right, ``g2`` to the left."
msgstr "折叠视图：基因模型排在一行里，外显子方块和内含子细线都按 GFF3 画。``g1`` 向右（5′→3′），``g2`` 向左。"

msgid "The same track with one gene expanded. Each transcript gets its own row, with CDS blocks darker than UTR and the introns drawn as connecting lines."
msgstr "同一条轨道，展开一个基因。每个转录本各占一行，CDS 比 UTR 深，内含子用连线表示。"

msgid "Right-clicking a model opens the same detail popover used for RefSeq, fed by the imported GFF3:"
msgstr "右键基因模型打开与 RefSeq 相同的详情浮层，内容来自导入的 GFF3："

msgid "Exon 4 of 4 on the minus strand, its interval and length, the matching CDS fragment, and all three introns with coordinates. Gene IDs read *not provided* because this GFF3 carries no ``ID=`` beyond the transcript name."
msgstr "负链上的第 4 个外显子（共 4 个），含区间、长度、对应的 CDS 片段，以及三个内含子的坐标。基因 ID 显示「未提供」，因为这份 GFF3 除了转录本名之外没有别的 ``ID=``。"

msgid "Base level from the imported FASTA: coloured nucleotides inside the exon, with the intron line ending at the exon boundary above."
msgstr "导入 FASTA 提供的碱基级视图：外显子内是彩色碱基，上方内含子线正好停在外显子边界。"

msgid "Things worth knowing"
msgstr "几点要注意"

msgid "**Sequence names must match between the two files.** ``chr1`` and ``1`` are treated as the same chromosome, but ``scaffold_1`` and ``Chr1`` are not. If the gene track says *no annotation in this region* while the FASTA has bases, the names are the first thing to check."
msgstr "**两个文件的序列名必须对得上。** ``chr1`` 与 ``1`` 视为同一条染色体，但 ``scaffold_1`` 与 ``Chr1`` 不是。如果 FASTA 有碱基、基因轨道却说 *此区域无注释*，先查名字。"

msgid "**The built-in sequence row stays empty.** It reads the reference 2bit, which a custom assembly does not have — the imported FASTA track is the sequence track to use. Hide the built-in row from the sidebar."
msgstr "**内置「序列」行会是空的。** 它读的是参考 2bit，自定义装配没有；该看的是导入的 FASTA 轨道。可以把内置那行从侧栏关掉。"

msgid "**No cytobands and no RefSeq.** Both bundled rows have nothing to draw on a custom assembly; hide them to keep the view compact."
msgstr "**没有染色体条带，也没有 RefSeq。** 这两条内置轨道在自定义装配上没内容可画，关掉能让视图更紧凑。"

msgid "**Search has to be pointed at your file.** The main search box reads the bundled RefSeq index by default; switch its scope dropdown to **All imported** or to the GFF3 track itself to look up genes by name."
msgstr "**搜索要指向你自己的文件。** 主搜索框默认查内置 RefSeq 索引；把左侧的范围下拉切到 **全部导入** 或直接选那条 GFF3，才能按名字找基因。"

msgid "**Nothing is persisted.** A custom assembly is assembled at import time from the tracks in the session, so the next launch starts empty again — the files stay under ``data/loaded`` and can be re-imported (see :ref:`imports-are-session-scoped`)."
msgstr "**不落盘。** 自定义装配是导入时用会话里的轨道临时拼出来的，下次启动又从空开始——文件仍留在 ``data/loaded`` 下，重新导入即可（见 :ref:`imports-are-session-scoped`）。"

msgid "If the assembly is going to be used repeatedly, the catalog route below is the better option: it compiles the annotation into the binary index and gives the assembly a name in the menu."
msgstr "如果这套装配要反复用，下面的 catalog 方式更合适：它把注释编译成二进制索引，并在菜单里给装配一个名字。"

msgid "Adding your own assembly"
msgstr "添加自己的装配"

msgid "Edit ``data/catalog.json`` and add an entry alongside the existing ones:"
msgstr "编辑 ``data/catalog.json``，在现有条目旁边加一条："

msgid "Then place ``genes.igvbin`` and ``cytoband.json`` under ``data/ann/myAssembly/``. The binary index is produced by the build scripts in ``build/``; see :doc:`how-it-works` for the format."
msgstr "然后把 ``genes.igvbin`` 和 ``cytoband.json`` 放到 ``data/ann/myAssembly/`` 下。二进制索引由 ``build/`` 里的构建脚本生成；格式见 :doc:`how-it-works`。"

msgid "Restart Orbit and the assembly appears in the selector. Nothing else needs to change — the frontend reads the catalog, not a hard-coded list."
msgstr "重启 Orbit，装配就会出现在选择器里。其它都不用改——前端读的是 catalog，不是硬编码列表。"
